{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in大阪\n無事終了しました‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方、\nわざわざ大阪まで来てくださった方、\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めーっちゃ楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに会えてめっちゃ嬉しかったです。\nいつもより関西弁なった><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服はお気に入りのラグランT一枚にした。\nめっちゃゆるい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段もけっこう着てる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型はね、ダウンゆる巻きからの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールにしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこ焼き食べた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんに熱いの無理やり口に入れられた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひーひーふーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休憩中、みさ先輩の肩もんでました。\n頑張ったらお小遣いもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ「はい、駄菓子でも買いなさい」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「～:D‼きらきら」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰ってホテルで真洋とマッサージしあいっこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脚と足の裏と肩と顔と背中..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身マッサージ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなことしてるんうちらだけやで\nて話してた笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのおかげで今めっっっっちゃスッキリしてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、ぐるぐるカーテン最後の握手会です‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気合い入れてめっちゃ楽しみます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にぎにぎも楽しみっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/29/5204987/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"http